~ start
if first_interaction:
	=> first_interaction
else:
	=> all_task_question

~ first_interaction
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Heyy! Happy 22nd birthday Sree!!!
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Thank You!
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: I know where aunty got the Cake from
do set_avatar("sree")
You: What?! How? Where?
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Some things are better kept secret ;) 
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Okay then, keep your secrets -_-

set first_interaction = false
=> all_task_question

~ all_task_question
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: So... all tasks done and spoke with everyone?
- Yup
	do set_avatar("sree")
	You: Yes, now tell me.
	if all_tasks_done:
		=> all_done
	else: 
		=> all_not_done
- Nope
	do set_avatar("sree")
	You: Nope, some are still left.
	do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
	RamenPaglu: Okay, complete them first mine will take some time.

set first_interaction = false

=> END

~ all_not_done
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Sree... I have a feeling you haven't, please do them first.
RamenPaglu: Mine will take time.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Fine! I will finish everything else first.
=> END

~ all_done
do EventManager.finish_task(EventManager.task_ids.talk_to_ramenpaglu)
do EventManager.start_event()

do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Great, now that everything is done.
RamenPaglu: Please stand there for me a bit Sree, or you can even sit down.
RamenPaglu: It will take a little bit of time.

set GameState.can_move = false
do GameState.sree.go_to("DrawEventSree", Vector2.LEFT)
do character.face_direction("right")

do set_avatar("sree")
You: Okay but what is it?
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Nothing much, Sagnik prolly gave you a perfume set and Upasana gave you a makeup set.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Yes, so?
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: So, I will gift you a paiting.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: A painting? Of whom, me?
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Yes, exactly! But it will be a live painting.
do paint(1)
RamenPaglu: So just sit still for a while.
do GameState.sree.set_still(true)
do paint(2)
do set_avatar("sree")
do GameState.sree.set_still(false)
You: ~~~
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Don't move, try to stay still please. It's almost done.
do set_avatar("sree")
do GameState.sree.set_still(true)
You: ...
do paint(3)
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: And here, We are done!
do paint(4)
do set_avatar("sree")
do GameState.sree.set_still(false)
You: Uff, finally.
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Here is your gift

do Ui.gift_box.give_gift("painting")

do set_avatar("sree")
You: Omg!! This is So Beautiful!!
You: Thank you!
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: But I ain't done yet though.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: There's more?
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Don't you see these gift boxes around me?
do set_avatar("sree")
You: ...
do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Well there is one more other than these...

if GameState.collectables_count >= 6:
	do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
	RamenPaglu: As far as I know you have already found the surprise (he he).
	- So funny
		do set_avatar("sree")
		You: Ha ha so funny, Mr. Comedian.
	- I will kill you
		do set_avatar("sree")
		You: If it werent my birthday today, I would have killed you for that!
	- You are the worst
		do set_avatar("sree")
		You: You are the absolute worst!
	do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
	RamenPaglu: I know, I know >_<
else:
	do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
	RamenPaglu: But sadly you haven't found all the collectables.
	RamenPaglu: And the day is about to end so..
	RamenPaglu: Better luck next play through the game I guess.
	do set_avatar("sree")
	You: Okay, will see...

do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Well... anyways coming back to the topic of gifts.
RamenPaglu: Here's a video for you.

do Ui.video_player.play_video("happy_birthday_duck")

do set_avatar("sree")
- Awww!
	You: Awww! Thank you ☺️!
- Thank You ^-^
	You: This is so cute, Thank You 🌝!
- Bruh!
	You: Bruh.... 😐

do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: He He 😁
RamenPaglu: Now the last but not the least...
RamenPaglu: Here is you Birthday card.

do Ui.give_card()

do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Oh btw, I will be putting this in status.

do Ui.video_player.play_video("birthday_edit")

do set_avatar("sree")
You: Do whatever you like, I can't stop you -_-

do set_avatar("ramenpaglu")
RamenPaglu: Lol I know.
RamenPaglu: Hope you enjoyed the experience.
RamenPaglu: Good Bye 👋

do EventManager.end_event(EventManager.event_ids.ending_event)
=> END